                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The clock is ticking. If we fail to act before the end of the year, Michigan families are going to see their health care premiums skyrocket.\n\nI led 36 of my colleagues today in calling on Congress to renew the ACA tax credits and lower health care costs. https://t.co/5vzWxYARan",
