                "text": "https://t.co/mvkpnUoOaj's window shopping period is finally open, and the marketplace opens on Nov 1.\n\nBecause of Congress' inaction, Michiganders will see premiums rise by 30%. That's insane. \n\nThe House needs to come back to Washington immediately to fix this.",
